TI  - The 2023 Latin America report of the Lancet Countdown on health and climate change: the imperative for health-centred climate-resilient development
T2  - LANCET REGIONAL HEALTH-AMERICAS
LA  - English
KW  - Climate change
KW  - Health
KW  - Health risks
KW  - Latin America
